========================================================================
E -- THE KINEMATIC OVERTURNING CRITERION, u_crest / c
========================================================================
In shallow water a long wave carries u = eta*sqrt(g/d) and c = sqrt(gd)
(beach.ur_half_derived states the first; beach.celerity the second),
so u/c = eta/d exactly, and the solitary-wave form is eta/(d+eta).
Overturning is u_crest >= c. Both forms are reported.

